Z||000000||Archie||06-15-2001||12:14 AM||||Many will remember that on our resent trip to the Dells show, my Black Fino was damaged by a Flying Window. (Hmmm "Flying Window"...sounds like a MS screen saver problem).<P>Anyway..... we find that it is necessary to repaint the whole car. We've got it preped for paint but can't seem to settle on a color.<P>I'm looking for suggestions. I have ruled out a couple of colors however. I already have too many Red cars, I'm already building a special Yellow show car, & the Black (current color) is way too hard to take good photos of.<P>I need to buy paint next week so I need some vote on what color to paint it.<P>Here are a couple of pics. of how it looked in Black.<P>Archie<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/image8large_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-005s_8.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-008s_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
